(text "U3 MID 5.216 V; upper DC corner 5.357 V BEFORE transients. U4 ceiling 5.5 V.\nU5 direct 5.011 V from VPROT, never from positive boost. 100n BOOT-to-SW each.\nEffective ceramic C, magnetic Isat/DCR/thermal and loop/transient response remain qualification gates." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "6b6229ad-0892-586c-a23c-e69797cb82d9"))
